.input|xhtml/1.0
.# Test that blocks separated by an empty line in a cell (e.g. paragraphs) are kept separated, with 2 line breaks
.#-----------------------------------------------------
<html><p>before</p><table><tr><th>a</th><th>b</th></tr><tr><td><p>x</p><p>y</p></td><td>z</td></tr></table></html>
.#-----------------------------------------------------
.expect|markdown/1.2
.#-----------------------------------------------------
before

|      a       |  b  |
| ------------ | --- |
| x<br/><br/>y |  z  |
